UID:ab80646f86d999ff2d20b3005e442cb6@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Tom for Dharma Recovery-a peer-led community space that i
 s unified by our trust in the potential of each of us to recover and find 
 freedom from the suffering of addiction. We believe that the traditional B
 uddhist teachings\, often referred to as the Dharma\, offer a powerful app
 roach to healing from addiction and living a life of true freedom. Class i
 s free.
